WEBVTT

00:03:27.830 --> 00:03:30.263
so we could show
everybody else how to do it."

00:03:31.363 --> 00:03:33.263
One of the students said, "Really?"

00:03:33.297 --> 00:03:35.563
(Laughter)

00:03:35.563 --> 00:03:38.563
I said, "Really. We have
to show the other classes

00:03:38.597 --> 00:03:41.030
how to do it, so when
we walk down the hall,

00:03:41.063 --> 00:03:43.597
people will notice us,
so you can't make noise.

00:03:43.597 --> 00:03:45.230
You just have to strut."

00:03:45.230 --> 00:03:46.430
(Laughter)

00:03:46.463 --> 00:03:48.097
And I gave them a saying to say:

00:03:48.130 --> 00:03:49.397
"I am somebody.

00:03:49.430 --> 00:03:50.763
I was somebody when I came.

00:03:50.797 --> 00:03:52.697
I'll be a better somebody when I leave.

00:03:52.730 --> 00:03:54.697
I am powerful, and I am strong.

00:03:54.697 --> 00:03:57.363
I deserve the education that I get here.

00:03:57.397 --> 00:03:59.763
I have things to do, people to impress,

00:03:59.797 --> 00:04:01.530
and places to go."